# Project conventions

## Implementation style (ponytail)

For every task in this repo, read and follow the **ponytail** skill before writing or changing code: `/Users/aakashsingh/.claude/skills/ponytail/SKILL.md` (shortest working diff, YAGNI, no unrequested tests/abstractions). Default intensity: **full** unless the user says otherwise.

## Tests

Do not add or expand test files unless the user explicitly asks for tests.

## Pi agent sessions (`pi.ts`)

- Use `runPiAgentTurn` for all Pi agent calls (one-shot or multi-turn).
- Track **`sessionId` only** — do not return or require `sessionFile` in the public API.
- First turn: pass a custom `sessionId` (e.g. `auction-designer`) or omit it for Pi to generate one. Same `cwd` on every turn.
- Later turns: `{ sessionId, resume: true }`.
- Pi session id format: alphanumeric, `-`, `_`, `.`; must start and end with alphanumeric.
